        "key": "DESC",
        "value": "A Lantern Bearer selects a creature type from the following:  aberration, animal, fey, humanoid (elf), outsider (evil), and plant. This ability functions like the ranger class ability of the same name, and Lantern Bearer levels stack with other class levels that grant the favored enemy ability. At 8th level, the Lantern Bearer can select an additional favored enemy from this list. In addition, the bonus against any one favored enemy from this list (including the one just selected, if so desired) increases by 2."
